{"id":"95b52ba126176a03","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-axiom-l-def.md","title":"GL Axiom L Definition","display":"df-gl-axiom-l-def — GL Axiom L Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-axiom-l-def","aliases":["89-df-gl-axiom-l-def"],"display":"df-gl-axiom-l-def — GL Axiom L Definition","depends_on":["[[89-df-lob-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-axiom-l-def"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-axiom-l-def</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-axiom-l-def — GL Axiom L Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the Löb schema (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{GL}}_L\">\\(\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{GL}}_L\\)</span> 是下述定义的 Löb 模式集别名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为区分逻辑系统的上标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}l\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}^{\\mathrm{GL}}_{L}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{A}_{L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}l\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}^{\\mathrm{GL}}_{L}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{A}_{L}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>L公理（Lob公理）是 GL 的特征公理</li>\n<li>与 K 的规则结合后，Löb 模式给出 GL 的特征公理。</li>\n<li>GL 对有限传递且非自反框架的刻画是可靠性与完全性定理，\n不能把它当作本别名定义直接推出的框架事实。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the Löb schema (see [[89-df-lob-axiom]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{GL}}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}l\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}^{\\mathrm{GL}}_{L}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{A}_{L}.","display":true}],"bytes":931,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-267","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-axiom-l-def]]"}],"outgoing":["491579297d817026"]}